        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If the <ref refid="structcuvis__imbuffer__t" kindref="compound">cuvis_imbuffer_t</ref> is not a hyperspectral cube, the value will be nullptr For cubes this is an array of length channels, the elements define the cube&apos;s wavelength in nanometers. </para>
